BashKitten Pi browser integration

Adapted from Wild Buzzard's Android Pi integration, AGPL-3.0-or-later:
https://github.com/openresearchtools/wildbuzzard-android
Source revision b970e591350863113c7ea1f110f12f296a1170bd
Files: wildbuzzard/android/pi/extension.mjs and client.mjs.

BashKitten changes replace browser-session ownership with explicit ordinary-tab
IDs, share the native Android/Linux/authorized-remote dispatcher, and register
the integration through stock Pi's package and skill interfaces.

Search skill attribution is recorded with the bundled search sources under
agent/search. Browser source and retained upstream notices are under browser/.

Browser workflow guidance reviewed and adapted on 24 September 2026 from the
same Wild Buzzard Android extension's native promptSnippet/promptGuidelines,
its desktop SKILL.md and WildBuzzardCommand.sys.mjs command catalog, and the
BrowserOS TypeScript snapshot/act/read contracts and mcp-prompt.ts at revision
5a4a9ef8f64522a9f20ccc212642ee4bba35ad49 (AGPL-3.0-or-later):
https://github.com/browseros-ai/BrowserOS/tree/5a4a9ef8f64522a9f20ccc212642ee4bba35ad49/packages/browseros-agent/packages/browser-mcp/src
BashKitten documents its actual native Android/Linux interfaces; donor session
ownership, MCP setup and workflow SDK commands are not part of that interface.
